### `src/content/categories.js`

The sidebar of each volume. `home` and `featured` come first and are not in the list (their labels are `nav.home` and `nav.featured`). The sub-label of every row is `sidebar.count.{volume}` with `{n}` replaced by `count`. A row with a `specimen` selects that tab; the others open `/collections/{slug}`. Labels are deliberately short in Mongolian, because the sidebar column is 196px wide.

